      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Consider writing or commissioning a small program that goes into your VRChat photos folder and auto-deletes Prints. \n\nDetect Print photos based on their aspect ratio (1.42:1 versus regular photos' 1.78:1 or 16:9). Then to make sure it doesn't delete other people's Prints that you've downloaded, have it also look at the previous photo to see if the picture on the print matches, if it does then delete the Print, and if it doesn't, move onto the next Print.",
