      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cfb491476b5b77800e860ec|full_name} while that's a possibility, that's yet another program running on someone's computer, highly specific, prone to errors...\n\nand most importantly, doesnt adress the fact that my post asks why and when anyone would even need to have the print saved to their gallery even tho they're the one taking the picture, which is *always* gonna give a duplicate",
