  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-24T13:12:20.049Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add an option to Print the taken picture only instead of \"print and save\"\n\nBecause when we take a picture with the print camera... it already saves it for us. there is no point in saving the print along in our folder, and if we print it we can then choose to save it to print gallery or download if we need the caption added.\n\nI take hundreds of pictures a week, make a quarter of those into prints.\n\nThat means I have to clean my prints out of my saved prints everyday (which is partially bugged), and delete the prints from my folder every time because they're just dupes.\n\nHaving a print only button as well or only just a \"Print\", allowing us to then save or download the printed save, would save a LOT of time and efforts sharing pictures with friends, without bloating everything.\n\nThank you",
